Bootstrap: docker
From: golang:1.23

%files
    ../Decirational /opt/decirational

%post
    cd /opt/decirational
    go build -o /usr/local/bin/decirational ./cmd/decirational

%runscript
    exec decirational "$@"

%labels
    Application Decirational
    Language Go
    GoVersion 1.23

%help
    Decirational calculator (Go implementation).
    Usage: apptainer run decirational.sif [--integer=decimal|tight] [--format=<format>] [--precision=N]
    Then type arithmetic expressions (supporting + - * / % ^, parentheses,
    [floor brackets] and |absolute value bars|) one per line on stdin.
